<article class="env-lemma" id="06JZ">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/06JZ">Lemma <span data-tag="06JZ">90.19.12</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{F}$ be a category cofibered in groupoids over $\mathcal{C}_\Lambda $ satisfying (RS). Let $x' \to x$ be a morphism in $\mathcal{F}$ lying over a surjective ring map. Let $x_0$ be a pushforward of $x$ to $\mathcal{F}(k)$. If $\text{Inf}_{x_0}(\mathcal{F}) = 0$ then $\text{Inf}(x'/x) = 0$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Follows from Lemmas <a href="/tag/06GE" data-tag="06GE">90.3.3</a> and <a href="/tag/06JY" data-tag="06JY">90.19.11</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>